{"seq":3,"slug":"tenant-tier-entitlement-quota","title":"租户套餐、权益与配额门控（plan/entitlement 建模、功能开关、限额与超限降级）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/saas-multi-tenant-model/tenant-tier-entitlement-quota","wordCount":2732,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"租户套餐-权益与配额门控-plan-entitlement-建模-功能开关-限额与超限降级\">租户套餐、权益与配额门控（plan/entitlement 建模、功能开关、限额与超限降级）</h1><p>同一个「导出订单报表」按钮，在 Starter 租户应当消失，在 Growth 每月可用 50 次，在 Enterprise 不限次、但导出超过 500 万行必须排队到夜间批处理。三家用同一份前端代码、同一个 API 端点、同一张查询表。若把差异写成散落各处的 <code>if (tenant.plan === &#39;pro&#39;)</code>，每次上新套餐、给某租户开例外、做 A/B 实验都要改代码并重新发布。SaaS 平台把「谁能用什么、能用多少」集中到一个独立概念层——<strong>权益（entitlement）</strong>。本文只讨论这一层；数据物理隔离见 <a href=\"tenant-isolation-model-archetypes\"><code>1_tenant-isolation-model-archetypes.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-套餐是商品-权益是授予-配额是计量\">核心概念：套餐是商品，权益是授予，配额是计量</h2><p>先拆开三个常被混用的词。**Plan（套餐）**是定价与销售单位，一份「买 X 得 Y」的目录条目。**Feature（功能）**是被门控的能力本体，用稳定标识符命名（如 <code>advanced-reporting</code>）。<strong>Entitlement（权益）<strong>是「某租户当前</strong>实际</strong>拥有某功能及其额度」这一事实。关键区别是：套餐是目录，权益是状态。租户换套餐改变权益输入；给大客户单独开白名单改变权益本身，完全不碰套餐。</p>\n<p>Stripe 的 Entitlements API 把这一层产品化了：Feature 用唯一 <code>lookup_key</code> 命名并挂到 Product 上，租户订阅后生成 <strong>active entitlement</strong>；订阅创建、升降级、取消触发 <code>entitlements.active_entitlement_summary.updated</code> webhook，应用据此开通或回收权限（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/entitlements\">Stripe Billing Entitlements</a>）。两个细节要提前知道：该事件的 <code>entitlements.data</code> 最多带 10 条权益，超出要顺 <code>entitlements.url</code> 分页取全；对已存在的订阅，改 Product 的 feature 关联要等下一账单周期才生效。权益按形状分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权益形状</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>门控点</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Boolean（布尔）</td>\n<td>有/无，无额度</td>\n<td>请求前置判定</td>\n<td>SAML SSO、自定义域名、API 访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Static（静态配置）</td>\n<td>有/无 + 一份 JSON 配置</td>\n<td>请求前置解析配置</td>\n<td>可用模型白名单、主题调色板、税率来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metered（计量）</td>\n<td>有/无 + 周期内余额</td>\n<td>请求前置 + 用量累加</td>\n<td>月导出次数、AI token、API 调用量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OpenMeter（2025 年被 Kong 收购）的对齐术语是：<strong>Subject</strong> 是使用事件里标识「谁在用」的键，<strong>Customer</strong> 是可订阅套餐、拥有权益的计费实体，<strong>Entitlement</strong> 定义某 Customer 对某 Feature 的访问与额度，计量型权益带 <strong>balance（余额）</strong>，可由 <strong>Grant</strong> 充值（来源：<a href=\"https://openmeter.io/docs/billing/entitlements/overview\">OpenMeter Entitlements Overview</a>）。设租户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、功能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，可用性可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">access</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">bool</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">metered</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">balance</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{access}(t,f,p) = \\operatorname{bool}(t,f) \\;\\wedge\\; \\bigl[\\,\\lnot\\operatorname{metered}(t,f)\\;\\vee\\;\\operatorname{balance}(t,f,p) &gt; 0\\,\\bigr]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">access</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">bool</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">metered</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">balance</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它是<strong>纯函数</strong>：给定租户快照、目录版本与周期，结论唯一且可离线回放。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;请求到达&lt;br/&gt;携带 tenant 上下文&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;解析 active entitlements&lt;br/&gt;租户 → 功能集合&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;功能是否 boolean/static?&quot;}&#10;  C -- 是 --&gt; D{&quot;具备该功能?&quot;}&#10;  D -- 否 --&gt; E[&quot;拒绝:升级提示&lt;br/&gt;402/403&quot;]&#10;  D -- 是 --&gt; F[&quot;读取静态配置&lt;br/&gt;继续业务&quot;]&#10;  C -- 否 --&gt; G{&quot;计量型:读取余额&quot;}&#10;  G --&gt; H{&quot;balance &gt; 0 ?&quot;}&#10;  H -- 否 --&gt; I{&quot;soft limit?&quot;}&#10;  I -- 是 --&gt; J[&quot;放行 + 累计 overage&lt;br/&gt;排队/降级&quot;]&#10;  I -- 否 --&gt; K[&quot;硬拒绝:429&lt;br/&gt;或排队重试&quot;]&#10;  H -- 是 --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; L[&quot;扣减用量&lt;br/&gt;写计量事件&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"请求到达&lt;br/&gt;携带 tenant 上下文\"] --&gt; B[\"解析 active entitlements&lt;br/&gt;租户 → 功能集合\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"功能是否 boolean/static?\"}\n  C -- 是 --&gt; D{\"具备该功能?\"}\n  D -- 否 --&gt; E[\"拒绝:升级提示&lt;br/&gt;402/403\"]\n  D -- 是 --&gt; F[\"读取静态配置&lt;br/&gt;继续业务\"]\n  C -- 否 --&gt; G{\"计量型:读取余额\"}\n  G --&gt; H{\"balance &gt; 0 ?\"}\n  H -- 否 --&gt; I{\"soft limit?\"}\n  I -- 是 --&gt; J[\"放行 + 累计 overage&lt;br/&gt;排队/降级\"]\n  I -- 否 --&gt; K[\"硬拒绝:429&lt;br/&gt;或排队重试\"]\n  H -- 是 --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; L[\"扣减用量&lt;br/&gt;写计量事件\"]</pre><h2 id=\"套餐与权益的数据建模\">套餐与权益的数据建模</h2><h3 id=\"授予日志而非可变行\">授予日志而非可变行</h3><p>把权益当成一张<strong>只增不改</strong>的授予日志，是这类系统最稳的起点：每行记录 <code>(entitlement_id, tenant_id, feature_key, shape, limit, config, source, effective_from, effective_to)</code>。<code>source</code> 区分「来自哪个套餐」与「来自人工开通」，这是排查「为什么这个租户有这个功能」的唯一线索。当前权益由日志按时间窗折叠得出，而非原地更新一行——原地更新会让撤销与审计都无从追溯。与面向单个终端消费者的会员等级（资格由行为推导、数量级百万）不同，SaaS 租户数量级千到万、资格由<strong>合同与销售动作</strong>决定，因此可以承受「每次变更写一条日志 + 出事件」换取审计完整性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"套餐目录的版本化\">套餐目录的版本化</h3><p>套餐目录需要版本化，因为<strong>改套餐不能让历史合同变脸</strong>。设套餐版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、判定时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，权益解析按生效时点选版本：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">planVersion</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">effectiveFrom</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>τ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{planVersion}(t,\\tau) = \\max\\{\\,v \\mid \\operatorname{effectiveFrom}(v) \\le \\tau\\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">planVersion</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">effectiveFrom</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。否则促销结束、老客户续约、试用转正会算出与合同不符的权益；跨境场景各地定价与合规不同，还要叠加 <code>region</code> 维度。折叠日志时，<strong>人工 grant 优先于套餐来源</strong>是刻意的：销售的例外必须能压过套餐默认值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"功能开关与权益解析的缓存与一致性\">功能开关与权益解析的缓存与一致性</h2><p>权益判定在每次请求里发生，但权益数据变更频率极低——每分钟几次量级，请求量却可能每秒数万。因此标准做法是<strong>本地缓存 + 事件驱动失效</strong>：每个服务实例持有一份「租户 → 权益集合」的内存视图，通过订阅变更流更新，而非每次请求回源数据库。</p>\n<p>用 feature flag 思路做开关时，要区分两种东西，它们<strong>不可混用</strong>。OpenFeature 定义了三个抽象：<strong>evaluation context</strong> 是运行时决策上下文（用户、IP、地域等属性），<strong>provider</strong> 是翻译到具体 flag 系统的适配层，<strong>hooks</strong> 是求值生命周期的扩展点（来源：<a href=\"https://openfeature.dev/docs/reference/intro\">OpenFeature Intro</a>）。授权与灰度发布语义不同：前者不能被随机分流影响——同一租户刷新两次页面绝不能一次有权限一次没有；后者恰恰要分流。把套餐权益做成带百分比滚出的 flag，是最常见的语义错误。缓存意味着<strong>权益变更不是瞬间全局生效的</strong>，对策是显式定义收敛时限并让它可观测：撤销类变更优先传播且下游有兜底——即使缓存未更新，计量与计费仍按新权益结算；授予类变更容忍更大延迟，但要有「立即生效」入口强制失效；本地视图打上 <code>entitlement_version</code> 并写入请求日志，使判定可复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限额门控与超限降级\">限额门控与超限降级</h2><p>计量型权益超过额度时的处理，是这个领域最需要设计而非实现的部分。术语上区分两种上限：**硬限额（hard limit）**达到即拒绝访问，OpenMeter 的 value API 通过 <code>hasAccess</code> 字段表达；<strong>软限额（soft limit）<strong>允许继续使用并把超出部分累计为 <strong>overage（超额）</strong>，单独的 <code>overage</code> 字段返回「超出限额的用量」（来源：<a href=\"https://openmeter.io/docs/billing/entitlements/entitlement\">OpenMeter Metered Entitlements</a>，页面更新于 2026-08-21）。选哪种不是技术偏好，而是</strong>商业风险判断</strong>：让租户的订单同步在月中被硬停，可能造成其真实业务损失；无上限放行则可能让平台被单一租户拖垮。</p>\n<p>降级应当做成一档而非一刀切。设额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、已用量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>、软阈值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、缓冲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>tier</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>normal</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>warn</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>soft-overage</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>hard-stop</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{tier}(u,L) = \\begin{cases} \\text{normal} &amp; u &lt; \\alpha L \\\\ \\text{warn} &amp; \\alpha L \\le u &lt; L \\\\ \\text{soft-overage} &amp; L \\le u &lt; L + \\Delta \\\\ \\text{hard-stop} &amp; u \\ge L + \\Delta \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">normal</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">warn</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">soft-overage</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hard-stop</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 触发「已用 80%」提醒；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 把超限从悬崖变成斜坡。降级动作应落在<strong>能力降级</strong>而非<strong>服务中断</strong>上：导出改异步排队、批量接口降为分页逐条、报表降为只读、AI 功能回退到更小模型。</p>\n<p>对于高并发入口（API 调用、搜索），落地的不是计数器而是<strong>限流桶</strong>。Shopify 的 GraphQL Admin API 给出可直接借鉴的量级：它用漏桶模型按套餐给出恢复速率——Standard 100 点/秒、Advanced 200 点/秒、Shopify Plus 1000 点/秒、Enterprise（Commerce Components）2000 点/秒；单次查询成本上限 1000 点；执行前的 <code>requestedQueryCost</code> 必须能在桶内放下，执行后按 <code>actualQueryCost</code> 退还差额；<code>throttleStatus</code> 暴露 <code>maximumAvailable</code>、<code>currentlyAvailable</code>、<code>restoreRate</code> 供客户端自适应退避（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/apis/graphql-admin/rate-limits\">Shopify GraphQL Admin API rate limits</a>）。要义是<strong>限额以「成本」而非「次数」计量</strong>，并把桶状态回传给调用方；只回 429 而不给可用余额，是自我制造的雪崩源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配额计量-超限告警与计费联动\">配额计量、超限告警与计费联动</h2><h3 id=\"计量的幂等与周期锚点\">计量的幂等与周期锚点</h3><p>门控依赖准确的用量数字，而用量来自计量事件流。计数必须<strong>幂等</strong>：同一订单导出被重试两次不能扣两次额度。做法是计量事件带唯一业务键（如 <code>tenant:feature:period:request_id</code>），写入时以该键去重，扣减在聚合层完成而非在请求路径里做读改写——请求路径里的 <code>count++</code> 在分布式环境下必然漂移。</p>\n<p>周期边界是第二个陷阱。额度按月重置听起来简单，但「月」的锚点因租户而异（签约日还是自然月），且应与账单周期对齐。OpenMeter 显式建模 <code>usagePeriod</code> 与 <strong>reset</strong>：重置时放置新聚合标记并结转 grant，且重置有<strong>每分钟一次的速率限制</strong>，因为历史数据被预聚合成一分钟粒度的块。含义很直接——<strong>不能允许任意时刻频繁重置周期</strong>，否则聚合层的分钟块会被切碎。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与账单的单一用量账本\">与账单的单一用量账本</h3><p>计费侧联动需要一个契约：限额判定与账单生成读取的必须是<strong>同一个用量账本</strong>。Stripe 的阈值机制提供参考模型：<code>billing_thresholds[amount_gte]</code> 在未结算金额达阈值时触发开票，<code>billing_thresholds[usage_gte]</code> 在用量达阈值时触发；金额阈值至少为 50 个最小货币单位，每个订阅只能设一个；且阈值发票<strong>不包含</strong>宽限期内上报的用量，只有开票时点前已产生的用量才被计入（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/usage-based/thresholds\">Stripe Usage Thresholds</a>）。最后一条正是「用量上报延迟」的体现：任何声称「达到额度瞬间就精确停服」的系统，都要面对事件还在管道中的事实。</p>\n<p>分层告警优于单点阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 站内 + 邮件提醒（附升级链接）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 进入软超限，降级但可用并累计 overage（秒级，本地缓存判定）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L+\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 硬停或排队并通知销售；周期结束结算 overage（小时级批处理）。在 B2B 里，超限往往不是要惩罚的事件，而是<strong>升级商机</strong>——设计目标不是把租户挡在门外，而是让「继续用」成为一次可完成的交易。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三层分开</strong>：Plan 是目录商品，Feature 是能力本体的稳定标识，Entitlement 是租户当前实际拥有的事实；混成一层会导致每次做例外都要改代码。</li>\n<li><strong>权益按形状分类门控</strong>：boolean 走前置判定，static 走配置解析，metered 走余额判定；检查点各不相同。</li>\n<li><strong>权益是只增不改的授予日志</strong>，<code>source</code> 区分套餐来源与人工 grant，人工 grant 优先级更高；套餐目录按生效时点版本化，历史合同不变脸。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存 + 事件失效是常态</strong>，撤销类变更需兜底、授予类变更需强制失效入口，本地视图携带 <code>entitlement_version</code> 以复现判定。</li>\n<li><strong>超限用斜坡不用悬崖</strong>：按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u/L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 分档触发提醒、软超限、硬停，降级落在能力降级而非服务中断。</li>\n<li><strong>高并发入口用漏桶按成本计量</strong>并把桶状态回传给调用方；<strong>计量事件必须幂等</strong>，周期重置显式且限速，限额判定与账单共享同一本用量账——用量上报永远有延迟，精确停服是幻觉。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"租户套餐、权益与配额门控（plan/entitlement 建模、功能开关、限额与超限降级）","id":"租户套餐-权益与配额门控-plan-entitlement-建模-功能开关-限额与超限降级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：套餐是商品，权益是授予，配额是计量","id":"核心概念-套餐是商品-权益是授予-配额是计量"},{"level":2,"text":"套餐与权益的数据建模","id":"套餐与权益的数据建模"},{"level":3,"text":"授予日志而非可变行","id":"授予日志而非可变行"},{"level":3,"text":"套餐目录的版本化","id":"套餐目录的版本化"},{"level":2,"text":"功能开关与权益解析的缓存与一致性","id":"功能开关与权益解析的缓存与一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"限额门控与超限降级","id":"限额门控与超限降级"},{"level":2,"text":"配额计量、超限告警与计费联动","id":"配额计量-超限告警与计费联动"},{"level":3,"text":"计量的幂等与周期锚点","id":"计量的幂等与周期锚点"},{"level":3,"text":"与账单的单一用量账本","id":"与账单的单一用量账本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"租户开通与模板化店面 onboarding（白标配置、子域/自定义域名映射、目录与种子数据初始化）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/saas-multi-tenant-model/tenant-storefront-provisioning-onboarding"},"next":{"title":"租户数据分区与行级隔离（shared schema + tenant_id、RLS 强制、分区键与索引设计）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/data-isolation-security/tenant-data-partition-row-level-isolation"}}